def get_best_schedule(workload, num_seqs):
    """
    Multi-restart exact-cost greedy + hybrid local search (2-opt swaps,
    or-opt reinsertions, segment reversals) + iterated local search with
    a diverse pool of local optima.

    1. Greedy construction picking the transaction whose append yields the
       lowest TRUE makespan (workload.get_opt_seq_cost), multi-start.
    2. Randomized greedy restarts (occasionally 2nd-best) for diversity.
    3. First-improvement local search with swaps, reinsertions, reversals.
    4. Perturb-and-repolish seeded from a pool of local optima until the
